      "exactBlocker": "The Kansas Judicial Council Petition for Expungement of Arrest Record carries revision KSJC 02/2013, which predates the 2025 House Bill 2393 amendments to K.S.A. 22-2410. Those amendments added the (a)(2) mandatory expungement category, restated the docket fee, and broadened the fee exemption in (b)(3)(B). Whether the Council has issued a later revision must be confirmed before release; kjc.ks.gov returns HTTP 403 to automated retrieval."
